- model: blawx.ruledoc
  pk: 1
  fields:
    ruledoc_name: "Home insurance policy - the rodents, insects, vermin and birds exclusion"
    rule_text: "Home insurance policy - the rodents, insects, vermin and birds exclusion\n\n1. Home insurance policy, the animal-damage exclusion: \"We do not cover any loss or damage caused by rodents, insects, vermin, or birds. However, this exclusion does not apply to: (a) loss or damage to your contents caused by birds; or (b) ensuing covered loss unless any other exclusion applies or where an animal causes water to escape from a household appliance, swimming pool or plumbing, heating or air conditioning system.\" TRUE here means the exclusion BITES -- the loss is NOT covered.\n2. The trigger: \"We do not cover any loss or damage caused by rodents, insects, vermin, or birds.\"\n3. Carve-out (a): \"this exclusion does not apply to: (a) loss or damage to your contents caused by birds\". Both limbs must hold -- contents damage by anything else, or damage by birds to anything else, is still excluded.\n4. Carve-out (b), first limb: the exclusion does not apply to \"(b) ensuing covered loss\", subject to the proviso that follows it.\n5. Carve-out (b), proviso: (b) is itself disapplied \"unless any other exclusion applies or where an animal causes water to escape from a household appliance, swimming pool or plumbing, heating or air conditioning system\". Each of the last three limbs is a condition about an ANIMAL CAUSING WATER TO ESCAPE from the item, not about loss or damage to the item."
    scasp_encoding: ''
    tutorial: ''
    owner: 1
    published: true
- model: blawx.workspace
  pk: 1
  fields:
    ruledoc: 1
    workspace_name: root_section
    xml_content: |-
      <xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml">
      <block type="unattributed_fact" id="l4b000001" x="40" y="40"><statement name="statements"><block type="new_category_declaration" id="l4b000002"><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="postfix">is an inputs</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000003"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">loss_or_damage_caused_by_rodents</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">loss or damage caused by rodents</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000004"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">loss_or_damage_caused_by_insects</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">loss or damage caused by insects</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000005"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">loss_or_damage_caused_by_vermin</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">loss or damage caused by vermin</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000006"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">loss_or_damage_caused_by_birds</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">loss or damage caused by birds</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000007"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">loss_or_damage_to_contents</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">loss or damage to contents</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000008"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">any_other_exclusion_applies</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">any other exclusion applies</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000009"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">a_household_appliance</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">a household appliance</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000010"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">a_swimming_pool</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">a swimming pool</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000011"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">a_plumbing_heating_or_air_conditioning_system</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">a plumbing heating or air conditioning system</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000012"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">loss_or_damage_ensuing_covered_loss</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">loss or damage ensuing covered loss</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000013"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">insurance_covered</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">insurance covered</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000014"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">loss_or_damage_by_animals</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">loss or damage by animals</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000015"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">damage_to_contents_and_caused_by_birds</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">damage to contents and caused by birds</field><next><block type="new_attribute_declaration" id="l4b000016"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" category_name="inputs" attribute_type="boolean"></mutation><field name="category_name">inputs</field><field name="attribute_name">ensuing_covered_loss</field><field name="attribute_type">boolean</field><field name="order">ov</field><field name="prefix"></field><field name="first_element">object</field><field name="infix"></field><field name="second_element">value</field><field name="postfix">ensuing covered loss</field><next><block type="new_attribute_